COMMENT 'Cost Estimator Functional Capabilities: authoritative category discovery for DCP and Lakemeter, including workload sizing. Lists implemented categories, not a guarantee of validated pricing; always disclose implementation_state and validation_state. Use estimator_catalog for detailed coverage.'
